# Exporter for the functor field-name mismatch diagnostic
# (todo/functor-field-name-mismatch-diagnostic.md).
#
# -dynamic mints the term class with PLACEHOLDER arg_0/arg_1 field names, and
# no real clause ever unseats it, so `fnm_verdict` is exported as a class whose
# _fields are ('arg_0', 'arg_1') even though the -module export list spells the
# signature fnm_verdict(STATUS, CITATIONS).
-dynamic(fnm_verdict/2)
-module(fnmismatch_schema, [fnm_verdict(STATUS, CITATIONS)])
